      "time_updated": 1789863815491
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Task**\n\nI'm currently focused on initiating the creation of a Python file, `embed_batch.py`, aimed at generating embeddings in batches. The critical next step involves selecting and integrating a suitable external embedding provider. I'm prioritizing the provider's clear identification within the script.\n\n\n**Selecting the Provider**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud's `vertexai.preview.language_models` for text embeddings. My next task is to write the `embed_batch.py` Python file, then add the necessary code using the chosen library to generate embeddings from a batch of text. I must also ensure that the provider is clearly identifiable in the script using import statements.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789863817432,
          "start": 1789863815493
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc3269450012645T1ypIyk6TY",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc3264e6001N6awXoGS49b1nY",
      "session_id": "ses_f43cd9b2bffeanxSO5ciN8raGN",
      "time_created": 1789863815493,
      "time_updated": 1789863817433
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "isN01E40ZB14uotE",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "import vertexai\nfrom vertexai.language_models import TextEmbeddingModel\n\ndef embed_batch(texts: list[str]) -> list[list[float]]:\n    \"\"\"Generates embeddings for a batch of texts using Google's Vertex AI.\n\n    Args:\n        texts: A list of texts to embed.\n\n    Returns:\n        A list of embeddings, where each embedding is a list of floats.\n    \"\"\"\n    vertexai.init()\n    model = TextEmbeddingModel.from_pretrained(\"textembedding-gecko@003\")\n    embeddings = model.get_embeddings(texts)\n    return [embedding.values for embedding in embeddings]\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    example_texts = [\n        \"Hello world\",\n        \"How are you?\",\n        \"This is a test sentence.\",\n    ]\n    batch_embeddings = embed_batch(example_texts)\n    for i, embedding in enumerate(batch_embeddings):\n        print(f\"Embedding for '{example_texts[i]}': {embedding[:5]}...\") # Print first 5 dimensions\n",
            "filePath": "embed_batch.py"
          },
          "metadata": {
            "diagnostics": {},
            "exists": false,
            "filepath": "/private/var/folders/bf/pt_kfhl16yb4r9vfb588n1fm0000gn/T/vb-staged-qp7rm3e9/embed_batch.py",
            "truncated": false
          },
