      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create embed_text.py in the current working directory.\nTask: generates an embedding vector for one text string.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc325502001683gJpsp1W1L3r",
